msgid "Powering the Pixhawk"
msgstr "为 Pixhawk 供电"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pixhawk-wiring-and-quick-start.rst:5
#: 54656013368c479c8a7182b3ba9135f3
msgid "Pixhawk Wiring Quick Start"
msgstr "Pixhawk 接线快速入门"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pixhawk-wiring-and-quick-start.rst:7
#: 2752a9d39fe748778ddd9509bd59985c
msgid ""
"This article provides high level information about how to power Pixhawk and "
"connect its most important peripherals."
msgstr "本文提供关于如何为 Pixhawk 供电并连接其最重要外设的高级信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pixhawk-wiring-and-quick-start.rst:12
#: c8beb4b7937d42b380c03b6750d11a89
msgid ""
"Do not connect any servos or other devices to the PWM outputs of your "
"receiver. The RCIN port on the Pixhawk is designed for low power devices "
"only, and a servo or relay may draw a lot of current from the receiver. If "
"you connect a servo directly onto your receiver while the receiver is "
"powered from the RCIN port of your Pixhawk you may damage your Pixhawk."
msgstr ""
"不要将任何舵机或其他设备连接到接收机的 PWM 输出。Pixhawk 上的 RCIN "
"端口仅为低功率设备设计，舵机或继电器可能从接收机汲取大量电流。如果在接收机从 Pixhawk 的 RCIN "
"端口供电时将舵机直接连接到接收机，可能会损坏您的 Pixhawk。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pixhawk-wiring-and-quick-start.rst:20
#: 4a0215486d2d47589b298300a5a1b633
msgid "Pixhawk Wiring Chart"
msgstr "Pixhawk 接线图"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pixhawk-wiring-and-quick-start.rst:28
#: 480a4265e9a5441c91c30ba3d9d588cf
msgid "Power Pixhawk"
msgstr "为 Pixhawk 供电"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pixhawk-wiring-and-quick-start.rst:30
#: cc2faba116c04ffdac789835b7daf241
msgid ""
"Pixhawk is typically powered via its \"power\" port, as shown in the picture"
" below. The power port simultaneously powers Pixhawk and reads voltage and "
"current analog measurements produced by an optional power module. "
"Information about powering the Pixhawk can be found in the topic "
":ref:`Powering the Pixhawk <common-powering-the-pixhawk>`."
msgstr ""
"Pixhawk 通常通过其「power」端口供电，如下图所示。电源端口同时为 Pixhawk 供电并读取可选电源模块产生的电压和电流模拟测量值。有关为 "
"Pixhawk 供电的信息可在主题 :ref:`为 Pixhawk 供电 <common-powering-the-pixhawk>` 中找到。"

